                        <field name="dc_subject">Ovino-Spain-1853 cattle </field>
                        <field name="dc_title">On the 4th of this month he informed the Council of the Excellent Mr. Pedro Cevallos, first Secretary of State and interim of the Office of Grace and Justice..., the Royal Order following [Printed Text]: "Hon. Mr. : Mr. Secretary of the Office of the Treasury... tells me the following: The King our Lord, by decree initialed of his Real hand, has served to resolve that by title or any pretext the extraction of the merino cattle is allowed, on which point the laws and the penalties established by them are kept and observed; </field>
